<title>USA: Creative BioMolecules work on kidney drug.</title>
<headline>Creative BioMolecules work on kidney drug.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Creative BioMolecules Inc and Biogen Inc have agreed to collaborate to develop a drug to help prevent kidney disease, The Wall Street Journal reported Tuesday.</p>
<p>Creative BioMolecules will receive as much as $123 million under the collaboration, the story says.</p>
<p>Some 45,000 Americans die of Kidney disease each year, the story says.</p>
